      "content": "yeah that's much more professional, thanks. i just want to make sure we don't sound like we're being exclusionary or elitist. sometimes when i talk about our \"special vibe\" or \"unique culture\" to people outside the company, it sounds almost like we're a little cult or a weird, closed-off group of creatures that only people like us can understand. how do i explain that we're just a very specific, high-energy group without making it sound like we're some kind of strange, isolated tribe?",
